  "description": "This package provides a robust and easy-to-use solution for adding resilience to HTTP requests in .NET applications. It leverages the power of Polly to implement retry policies, circuit breakers, and timeouts, ensuring that your HTTP calls can gracefully handle transient failures, timeouts, and network issues. Ideal for microservices, distributed systems, or any application that relies on external HTTP-based services, this package simplifies the implementation of resilience patterns for HTTP communication.",
